# RefactorGPT Tools – Cursor rules

Project: Ruby CLI tools for refactoring (refactor_gpt.rb), code search (ag_gpt.rb), bash generation (bash_gpt.rb), Q&A (ask_gpt.rb), git commit (git_commit_gpt.rb), superagent TUI (superagent.rb). Shared code in lib/ (commit_path_corrections, openai_client, gemini_client, llm_router for model→backend routing); superagent in lib/superagent/ (agent_executor, agent_prompt_builder, assistant_text_accumulator, attempt_execution, display, json_stream_parser, stream_filter, stream_line_parser, tool_call_formatter, outcome_display, pass_timing_builder, pass_timing_display, process_descendants, queue_display, request_history_formatter, request_preparer, run_failure_classifier, test_runner_detector, verification_display, verification_handler, session_tracker, request_reader, pending_request_queue, auto_only_lock, config_path). Config: .env with MODEL, TECHNICAL_MODEL, IMAGE_MODEL; backend from model name. Tests in test/.
